  "hints": [
    "Fix the second operand at 1111 and use C_0 = 0.",
    "At bit 0, Y_0 = A_0 XOR 1 and C_1 = A_0.",
    "For i = 1..3, Y_i = A_i XOR 1 XOR C_i.",
    "For i = 1..3, C_(i+1) = A_i + C_i.",
    "C_4 = 1 means no unsigned borrow; C_4 = 0 means a borrow occurred."
  ]
